mc(4, 'simple', 'Which of these tissues is dead at maturity?', 'Sclerenchyma', ['Collenchyma', 'Parenchyma', 'Companion cells'], 'Sclerenchyma has thick lignified walls and no protoplasm at maturity. Collenchyma, parenchyma and companion cells are living.');
